WEBVTT

00:01.360 --> 00:03.280
Someone bring me my sword.

00:04.480 --> 00:05.880
Yes.

00:10.880 --> 00:15.733
This reform since it has begun must be carried through to the end.

00:21.760 --> 00:25.840
Have someone deliver this sword to Xie Xuan whoever dares obstruct the new policies.

00:27.200 --> 00:29.800
I authorize him to execute first and report later.

00:36.500 --> 00:58.000
The aristocratic clans across multiple regions formed a united grand army, vowing to execute Xie Xuan to purge the court of treachery.

